<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZFOE final settlement prices for NZ March futures.</title>
<headline>NZFOE final settlement prices for NZ March futures.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Futures and Options Exchange on Wednesday said the final settlement prices for its March futures contracts were: 92.39 for the 90-day bank bill future contract; 92.32 for the three-year bond future contract; and 92.31 for the ten-year bond future contract.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
